OL,3,GNEWSAGreat British Railways HQ location
OL,4,Aconfirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe headquarters of the new state-owned
OL,7,Fbody for the country's railways has
OL,8,Fbeen announced.
OL,10,FTwo sites in Derby were shortlisted to
OL,11,Fbecome the home of Great British
OL,12,FRailways, with the former Duckworth
OL,13,FSquare, next to the Vaillant Live
OL,14,Fentertainment venue, being confirmed by
OL,15,Fthe government.
OL,17,FThe decision comes after a planning
OL,18,Fapplication was submitted to build an
OL,19,Feight-storey office building on the
OL,20,Fbrownfield site, which forms part of
OL,21,FDerby's wider #200m Becketwell
OL,22,Fregeneration scheme.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
