OL,4,Aconfirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said the decision marked
OL,7,Fa "significant milestone" which is
OL,8,Fexpected to bring "hundreds of jobs" to
OL,9,Fthe area and a #151m boost to the wider
OL,10,Fregional economy.
